      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "##**Bank of England Credit Conditions Survey**\n",
        "\n",
        "This section examines the Bank of England’s Q3 2026 Credit Conditions Survey, focusing on unsecured lending to households.\n",
        "\n",
        "The analysis compares Q2 and Q3 2026 net percentage balances for:\n",
        "\n",
        "* Unsecured credit availability.\n",
        "* Credit card default rates.\n",
        "* Other unsecured default rates.\n",
        "* Total unsecured default rates.\n",
        "\n",
        "The quarterly changes are calculated to identify shifts in reported lending conditions.\n",
        "\n",
        "Interpretation note: Net percentage balances represent the difference between lenders reporting increases and decreases. They are not percentages of individual borrowers who defaulted."
      ],
