        "##**Conclusion and Recommendations**\n",
        "\n",
        "This project combined UK consumer credit statistics, the Bank of England Credit Conditions Survey and synthetic borrower-level data to explore credit risk analysis and predictive modelling.\n",
        "\n",
        "The Bank of England analysis identified an overall increase in consumer credit outstanding between January 2021 and September 2026. The Credit Conditions Survey also showed that net percentage balances for reported increases in unsecured default rates remained positive in Q3 2026, despite declining compared with Q2.\n",
        "\n",
